smbpal (0.1.0) unstable; urgency=medium

  * First package. Daemon, command line, GTK4 window and tray icon, all
    speaking to one socket.
  * Ships the systemd unit, the sysusers group, the desktop entries and the
    hicolor status icons that M6 needed installed before a panel would draw
    anything at all.

